  "body": "Our vendors are serious about selling! Disregard the CV and online estimates - they do not reflect our vendors' expectations. If you've ruled this property out on price, now is the time to reconsider. Don't miss the upcoming auction!\r\n\r\nA property cherished by the same family for a generation, this solid and well-maintained home occupies a substantial site with captivating views down the Tamaki Estuary and exceptional potential for the future.\r\n\r\nWhether you choose to enjoy the home as it is, renovate and extend, or explore redevelopment opportunities, the options here are compelling. Bathed in natural light, the home features north facing living spaces, a generous sun-soaked patio, and a warm comfortable environment for everyday family living.\r\n\r\nThe expansive grounds provide plenty of space for children to play, while the waterfront, local shops and Roberta Reserve are all just moments away. Positioned within sought-after Glendowie School and Glendowie College zones, and benefiting from Mixed Housing Suburban zoning, this is a rare opportunity to secure a property offering both lifestyle appeal and future upside.",
